msgstr "Proton Photos ebenfalls herunterladen"

#: ui/qml/main.qml:284
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your timeline is copied into {folder}, checked every half hour. Nothing in "
"Proton Photos is changed or deleted by it."
msgstr ""
"Nur lesend: Ihre Zeitleiste wird in diesen Ordner kopiert: {folder}. In "
"Proton Photos werden nie Fotos hochgeladen, geändert oder gelöscht, und die "
"Kopie wird jede halbe Stunde geprüft."

#: ui/qml/main.qml:285
msgid "your Pictures folder"
msgstr "Ihr Ordner „Bilder“"

#: ui/qml/main.qml:297
msgid "Upload photos from a folder"
msgstr ""

#: ui/qml/main.qml:333
msgid "Delete uploaded photos instead of moving them to the trash"
msgstr ""

#: ui/qml/main.qml:341
msgid ""
"Photos and videos put in this folder go up to Proton Photos within a minute, "
"then leave the folder. Anything that cannot be uploaded stays."
msgstr ""

#: ui/qml/main.qml:388
msgid "Drive on the web"
